{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1000_p", "source_sha256": "23c6399ecfde635d0fa16bffcbbb5a0654330670123f342254fb71ba7e824f6f", "ja": "（亜利沙の撮影に付き添っている。空港のグランド\nスタッフに扮しての撮影だったが、無事終わった……）", "zh": "（我陪着亜利沙参加拍摄。虽然这次拍的是她扮演机场地勤人员的场景，但总算顺利结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "ee1f6ec84e8b9484749d82ac3c971bb88c158db918c8d4748f6f57a7d6a46d3e", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお待たせしちゃって、すみません……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n让您久等了，真是对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1002_p", "source_sha256": "544942de1f592cb66362926c250a0c3d8750f900b14de25013d248432d4266b8", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。あとは帰るだけだしな。\nそれにしても、何かあったのか？", "zh": "没关系。反正之后只要回去就行了。\n话又说回来，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "ca8e3424b8ce9575f36561d701977b5615971ef0cca8a7364da1185b95bc0a05", "ja": "うう～。実は……着替えに向かう途中で、本物の\nグランドスタッフさんと間違えられちゃったんです！", "zh": "呜呜～。其实……我去换衣服的路上，被误当成\n真正的地勤人员了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "b07d6d383b8e60a23c4a11455a4e862ec008c2c894545d1883f466d4dee51352", "ja": "ありさ、すごく混乱しちゃって……。でも気付いたん\nです。その方の荷物に付いてた見覚えのあるグッズを！", "zh": "亚利沙整个人都混乱了……但后来注意到了哦。\n那位的行李上挂着眼熟的周边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "e0a7300a9c7438cd931e3ede68c1a1a58100b8232b27062d183795fa0d90c5cf", "ja": "海外から遠征してきたドルオタさんみたいでして。\nアイドルちゃん達の話で盛り上がっちゃいました！", "zh": "好像是从海外专程赶来的偶像宅。我们聊起偶像们的话题后，一下子就聊得热火朝天了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d00d65a18f5cf997dc57a81914dc65d7a4256bf6ef1f0040930e3da07ecdb105", "ja": "そ、そうか……。グッズをきっかけに\n交流を図るなんて、亜利沙らしいな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……以周边为契机和人交流，还真像是亚利沙会做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "6e00bf67ea643a814c6a4968265f3e98f4f881ef16fd2cf4ce9a61467e3c0cbc", "ja": "えへへ～。あっ、劇場のアピールもしておきましたから\n次は劇場でお会いできるかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿～啊，我还顺便宣传了一下剧场，说不定下次就能在剧场见到他了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0542_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8b2eaa9da98bc1f5288ac65e79a69c903c0af672c9b4e27731c050cc25a0795d", "ja": "（亜利沙にとっても、その人にとっても\n今日の出会いが、いい思い出になったみたいだな！）", "zh": "（对亜利沙来说，对那个人来说，今天的相遇似乎都成了一段美好的回忆！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
